**Details of selected modules**
BERT: lexical module of 1–2 layers, syntactic module of 11–12 layers, structural module of 7–8 layers. 

CodeBERT: lexical module of 5–6 layers, syntactic module of 1–2 layers, structural module of 3–4 layers. 

