CodeGPT: lexical module of 8–9 layers, syntactic module of 1–2 layers, structural module of 4–5 layers. 

PolyCoder: lexical module of 11–12 layers, syntactic module of 3–4 layers, structural module of 11–12 layers. 

CodeGen: lexical module of 11–12 layers, syntactic module of 1–2 layers, structural module of 7–8 layers.
